Purpose: OpenAI codex-plugin-cc 1.0.6 records imported Windows paths with the
Rust verbatim prefix (\\?\), while Node realpathSync omits it. The live Claude
JSONL may also grow between import and lookup, invalidating the strict hash.
The patch normalizes paths and treats the hash as a preference. Remove this
patch only after a newer official plugin version passes a real Windows
transfer test against your own installed plugin.
